#: README.md:1
msgid "AlphaFold-Metainference tutorial"
msgstr "AlphaFold-Metainference Tutorial"

#: README.md:2
msgid ""
"A tutorial to setup and run AlphaFold-Metainference simulations. The "
"original work which explains the theory for AlphaFold-Metainference (AF-MI) "
"can be found [here](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-56572-9)."
msgstr ""
"AlphaFold-Metainference の設定と実行を学ぶ Tutorial です。AlphaFold-Metainference (AF-"
"MI) の理論を説明する原著は [こちら](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-56572-9) "
"にあります。"

#: README.md:4
msgid "The tutorial comprises the following sections:"
msgstr "次の節で構成されます。"

#: README.md:6
msgid "AlphaFold-Metainference theory"
msgstr "AlphaFold-Metainference の理論"

#: README.md:7
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the theory and advantage in using AlphaFold-"
"Metainference."
msgstr "AlphaFold-Metainference の理論と利点の簡単な紹介。"

#: README.md:9
msgid "Case study: TDP-43 WtoA monomer dynamics"
msgstr "Case Study：TDP-43 WtoA Monomer の Dynamics"

#: README.md:10
msgid ""
"We will present the case study for this tutorial, the DNA/RNA processing "
"protein TDP-43 which undergoes both functional and pathogennic aggregation "
"in amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS) and other neurodegenerative "
"conditions. To enable a rapid structural ensemble generation on a "
"laptop/workstation, AF-MI is coupled to the CALVADOS-2 coarse-grained "
"forcefield."
msgstr ""
"DNA/RNA の処理に関わる TDP-43 を例に扱います。TDP-43 は Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis (ALS) "
"などの神経変性疾患で、機能的な Aggregation と病的な Aggregation の両方を起こします。Laptop/Workstation で "
"Structural Ensemble を迅速に生成するため、AF-MI を CALVADOS-2 Coarse-grained Force Field"
" と組み合わせます。"

#: README.md:12
msgid "Input files preparation"
msgstr "入力ファイルの準備"

#: README.md:13
msgid ""
"We will discuss all the preliminary steps to set up AF-MI, from generating "
"the AF2 distance-map restraints data, to preparing PLUMED inputes, and "
"running energy minimization and production runs"
msgstr ""
"AF2 Distance-map Restraint データの生成、PLUMED 入力の準備、Energy Minimization、本計算まで、AF-"
"MI の設定に必要な手順を説明します。"

#: README.md:15
msgid "Structural ensemble generation and post-processing analysis"
msgstr "Structural Ensemble の生成と後処理解析"

#: README.md:16
msgid ""
"Finally, we will discuss how to generate the unbiased structural ensemble of"
" TDP-43, estimate free energy surfaces along collective variables (CVs) and "
"predict ensemble averaged properties such as secondary structureand RMSF."
msgstr ""
"最後に、Bias を除いた TDP-43 の Structural Ensemble の生成、Collective Variables (CVs) "
"に沿う自由エネルギー表面の推定、Secondary Structure や RMSF などの Ensemble Average の予測を説明します。"

#: README.md:18
msgid ""
"___NB:___ This tutorial assumes that you know metadynamics theory and "
"practice in PLUMED (if not, a good start can be the [PLUMED "
"tutorial](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/21/004/data/NAVIGATION.html) about it)."
msgstr ""
"___注：___ PLUMED の Metadynamics の理論と実践を知っていることを前提とします。未習の場合は、関連する [PLUMED "
"Tutorial](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/21/004/data/NAVIGATION.html) から始めるとよいでしょう。"

